hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"124","La ilaha illa anta subhanaka innee kuntu min ath-thalimeen. There is no god but You; glorified are You. Indeed, I have been among the wrongdoers."
"125","Allāh, Allāhu Rabbī lā ushriku bihi shay'a. Allah, Allah is my Lord. I do not associate anything with Him. Reference: Abu Dawud 2/87. See also Al-Albani, Sahih Ibn Mdjah 2/335."
